Done. Summary of fixes:

**BUG-WEB-031 ΓÇö Footer CTA button visibility + column wrapping**

**1. CTA button** (`ds-footer.css:30-38`): The `background` property was absent (transparent default) and the `border` used a barely-visible `color-mix(sky-blue 55%, transparent)`. The button had no visual weight as a CTA on the dark navy footer. Fixed by adding `background: color-mix(amber 15%)` and a solid `border: 1px solid var(--do-amber)` with amber text. Hover fills fully amber with prussian-blue text.

**2. Column wrapping** (`ds-footer.css:14-18`): The `.f-top` grid children had no `min-width:0`, allowing the brand column to expand beyond its track and push link columns into bad wraps. Fixed by adding `.f-top > *{ min-width:0 }` and tightening responsive gaps at 900px and 560px breakpoints.
